    <guid isPermaLink="false">6af0820f5b7c4709bfe2f6f0</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>世间 CP 千千万，嗑生嗑死每一天💗</span><br><span>走近嗑学的世界，看看今天谁挂科🤔</span></p><p><strong><span>ε==(づ′▽`)づ 你的嗑突然出现！今天来聊聊早早早早早就想聊的嗑 CP ～</span></strong></p><p><span>嗑 CP 看似全凭缘分，实则也是一门学问！</span><br><span>今天就由嗑学主理人狗老师，</span><strong><span>带大家走近嗑学、了解嗑学，</span></strong><span>从圈内黑话到关系分析，从嗑糖逻辑到阅读理解，一起成为合格的嗑学家🫡</span></p><p><span>本期可以听到：嗑 CP 黑话科普 ➕&nbsp;首届朋嗑儿嗑学能力考试</span><br><span>⚠️收听预警：本期有点吵，请大家见谅🩷🩷🩷🩷🩷</span></p><p><strong><span>戳👇空降</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="633">10:33</a> 嗑学黑话大扫盲💪</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1377">22:57</a> 🔛&nbsp;考试开始</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1384">23:04</a> 单项选择题</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a> 情景填空题</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3571">59:31</a> 阅读理解 1《你还记得密码吗？》</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5287">88:07</a> 阅读理解 2《我最讨厌的人》</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6798">113:18</a> 🔚&nbsp;公布分数</span></p><p><strong><span>戳👇看考卷</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkS-BZDE2hDxaxh8-wZv_5eycuXU.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjhOeq8S-F6FqxmEr7bVzw7giLjM.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs0D3MSfeZvSeUpWvFMXNiYUzpMa.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhNRm29_G-FkTkGtULhKDOgyBN_K.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk8q1zf--mPQRVtI42RENmpAKf9j.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnbKCrYf2udYM2lS4w_2sAc4_cEL.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnB1omkuv-qvprNZkqO4jueiQm4v.jpg"><p></p><p><strong><span>欢迎大家在评论区交出自己的嗑学答卷！</span></strong><span>也欢迎补充题目、分享那些让你嗑生嗑死的神仙 CP～</span><br><span>也可以在【朋嗑儿】公众号/小红书私信投稿，下期再见啦👋👋</span><br></p><p><strong><span>【🎤本期主播】：</span></strong><span>老金、王狗、苏仔</span><br><strong><span>【🙋‍♀️半永久主播】：</span></strong><span>争争</span><br><strong><span>【🩷特邀高材生】：</span></strong><span>二姐</span><br><strong><span>【⏱本期时长】：</span></strong><span>117分钟</span><br><strong><span>【🎵本期BGM】：</span></strong><span>OP-《Everything is romantic featuring caroline polachek》By Charli xcx/Caroline Polachek 、ED-《What is Love?》By TWICE</span></p>]]></description>
