    <title>Vol.156 宇宙无穷尽，我马上相信</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a13139ae59ebca936372273</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a13139ae59ebca936372273</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>世间万物太广阔，精彩故事那么多👏</span><br><span>传说假说和真说，信不信都说一说🫡</span></p><p><span>书接上回，</span><strong><span>朋嗑儿 · 相信相信的相信 · 胡咧咧2.0报到！</span></strong><br><span>这次为大家带来了一些真真假假、或实或虚、有理有据、有头有尾、胡说八道、爱信不信的大合集。</span><br><strong><span>从玄学洞察到文明假说，从冷战秘闻到外星研究，从奇闻异事到埃及猜想，</span></strong><span>祝您听得开心🥳</span></p><p><span>⚠️温馨声明：本台及听友真的都不是大傻子❤️</span><br></p><p><strong><span>戳👇空降</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="432">07:12</a> 人人都是命运观测者</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1316">21:56</a> 远古巨石文明假说</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1958">32:38</a> 三清山巨蟒峰</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpsmjFftllVnon5gIw7U-VtiBgtj.png"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2094">34:54</a> 波浪谷长这样</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm2EHbGxpjXNHObjea4_I1Hmo6q9.png"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2163">36:03</a> 南京阳山碑材</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nmguzC1gSipq2fELs9RboY0GXnh5.png"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2548">42:28</a> 埃及巨大神像</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuq85K9coTdQsiz8TFbPZLAJBKcr.png"></figure><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2851">47:31</a> 美国人要用核弹炸月球</span></strong></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkPblmYgUGJGrLEEd5gdzJQnFh8L.png"></figure><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3791">63:11</a> 外星人在地球项目研究成果汇报</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3957">65:57</a> 语言模块来源</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4411">73:31</a> 地面监督系统</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5327">88:47</a> 黑镜湖传说</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5870">97:50</a> 金字塔底下的发现</span></strong></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrgR5cMeDPAYJ6jyY0xm8lBQ2shk.png"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6656">110:56</a> 复活猜想</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpZArmw8WuF4Iu7u-KOJ5ToTel29.png"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7056">117:36</a> 水利脉冲泵猜想</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7183">119:43</a> 特斯拉的自由能源猜想</span></p><p><br><span>如果你也有想听嗑讲的内容，欢迎多多留言，也可以【朋嗑儿】公众号/微博/小红书私信投稿~</span><br><span>下期再见啦👋</span><br></p><p><strong><span>【🎤本期主播】：</span></strong><span>老金、王狗、苏仔</span><br><strong><span>【🙋‍♀️半永久主播】：</span></strong><span>争争</span><br><strong><span>【⏱本期时长】：</span></strong><span>129分钟！大！放！送！</span><br><strong><span>【🎵本期BGM】：</span></strong><span>OP-《KNOW ABOUT ME》By NMIXX 、ED-《Latata》By 幾田りら</span></p>]]></description>
