  <item>
    <title>Vol.155 神话里的神，全是外星人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a00a468e1eb34a939201c97</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a00a468e1eb34a939201c97</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 11 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>天上到底有什么？月亮背面是what❓ </span><br><span>神话故事真的喔？本期一起听个乐🛸</span></p><p><strong><span>好久不见的「狗姐说书」突然返场！ ！！</span></strong><br><span>本期和大家走近</span><strong><span>一个神奇的假说</span></strong><span>，说不定会颠覆你的世界观，重塑对自然、人类、月亮、神话的理解🤯</span><br><span>本期内容节选自《外星人就在月球背面》，感兴趣的朋友可以去读读看~</span></p><p><strong><span>戳👇空降</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="272">04:32</a> 不符合时代之物</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frycnik7nHMEWHALN7StbUnrAcVX.png"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs7SRiDGHJJaFJU9UMKsLW1Kq551.png"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlL91jsq5-cZKPG94bqva_2hPx05.png"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="701">11:41</a> 怀疑怀疑的怀疑 </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="943">15:43</a> “天”到底是啥？ </span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmG7Y635vSIcmHITTQpoh9SfLIaz.png"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FutetfxzXnQ3CptiAQTnx70UaR6A.png"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1493">24:53</a> 扑朔迷离的月亮 </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2364">39:24</a>《山海经》里的基因工程 </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3216">53:36</a>诸神之战与核武器 </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3739">62:19</a> 共工怒触不周山与地轴倾斜 </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4082">68:02</a> 大洪水的真相 </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4182">69:42</a> 跨星系挽救计划（雾） </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4439">73:59</a> 天，空了</span></p><p><strong><span>如果你也有「马上相信」的传说/故事/假说</span></strong><span>，欢迎多多留言，也可以【朋嗑儿】公众号/小红书私信投稿~</span><br><span>下期马上相信再见啦👋</span></p><p><strong><span>【🎤本期主播】：</span></strong><span>老金、王狗、苏仔 </span><br><strong><span>【🙋‍♀️半永久主播】</span></strong><span>：争争 </span><br><strong><span>【⏱本期时长】：</span></strong><span>79分钟 </span><br><strong><span>【🎵本期BGM】：</span></strong><span>OP-《MOONLIGHT SUNRISE》By TWICE、ED-《你看你看月亮的脸》By 孟庭苇</span></p>]]></description>
